WEBVTT

01:13.000 --> 01:17.000
[Meet Yourself]

01:17.000 --> 01:22.280
[Episode 01]

01:52.313 --> 01:53.562
This way, please.

01:53.563 --> 01:54.723
Manager Xu.

01:55.723 --> 01:56.232
Good morning.

01:56.233 --> 01:57.233
Morning.

01:58.923 --> 02:00.392
Here's your key card.

02:00.393 --> 02:01.393
Thanks.

02:02.913 --> 02:03.889
Hello.

02:03.913 --> 02:04.913
Check out?

02:06.193 --> 02:08.723
Could you tell me your room number, please?

02:11.193 --> 02:14.793
701. I get it.

02:16.403 --> 02:17.403
Okay.

02:19.123 --> 02:19.752
Lisa.

02:19.753 --> 02:21.283
Find a table for our guest.

02:21.593 --> 02:22.632
Enjoy your meal.

02:22.633 --> 02:23.632
Thank you.

02:23.633 --> 02:24.722
What's your room number?

02:24.723 --> 02:25.792
328.

02:25.793 --> 02:26.193
Okay.

02:26.193 --> 02:27.403
This way, with me.

02:33.073 --> 02:34.073
Helen.

02:35.513 --> 02:36.682
Madam.

02:36.683 --> 02:37.882
Are you hurt?

02:37.883 --> 02:38.792
I'm fine.

02:38.793 --> 02:40.282
Be careful of the shattered glass.

02:40.283 --> 02:41.283
Sure.

02:42.283 --> 02:43.163
I can do it myself.

02:43.163 --> 02:45.243
I see you wearing a short skirt.

02:45.883 --> 02:46.792
Terribly sorry.

02:46.793 --> 02:47.842
Terribly sorry.

02:47.843 --> 02:49.402
My apology.

02:49.403 --> 02:51.752
The executive suites are fully booked
this weekend.

02:51.753 --> 02:53.722
Much as I want to,
I cannot upgrade it for you.

02:53.723 --> 02:55.192
How about this?

02:55.193 --> 02:58.192
I will prepare two meal tickets
as you check in as present.

02:58.193 --> 03:00.073
I will give you an upgrade the next time.

03:00.633 --> 03:02.163
See you tomorrow, Mr. Liu.

03:03.883 --> 03:05.593
[Restroom]

03:05.593 --> 03:08.072
We have more guests during holidays.

03:08.073 --> 03:11.002
The receptionists must stay alert.

03:11.003 --> 03:13.873
Do not miss any
guests as they walk in.

03:15.283 --> 03:18.633
As for the luggage deposit,
double-check the claim tag!

03:19.003 --> 03:22.073
The incident yesterday
must be avoided.

03:35.353 --> 03:36.963
Aunt!

03:37.563 --> 03:39.163
Lingdang!

03:39.163 --> 03:40.473
Let mom have the phone.

03:42.073 --> 03:43.962
I sent you the message the day before.

03:43.963 --> 03:44.793
About what?

03:44.793 --> 03:46.033
She must be too busy.

03:46.403 --> 03:46.963
Let me talk.

03:46.963 --> 03:48.682
Is that mom talking?

03:48.683 --> 03:50.313
You're not in Shanghai. You're back!

03:50.313 --> 03:51.123
Hongdou.

03:51.123 --> 03:52.313
It's your father's birthday today.

03:52.313 --> 03:54.003
You must have forgotten.

03:55.243 --> 03:56.033
Not at all!

03:56.033 --> 03:58.123
I was about to call you!

03:58.683 --> 03:59.683
Dad!

04:00.033 --> 04:01.033
Come over.

04:02.313 --> 04:03.753
Have you eaten?

04:04.073 --> 04:05.162
I'm having it now.

04:05.163 --> 04:06.753
Happy birthday, dad.

04:08.403 --> 04:08.963
How's your stomach?

04:08.963 --> 04:10.363
I told you to see a doctor.

04:10.363 --> 04:11.242
Did you do it?

04:11.243 --> 04:12.752
I'll get a gastroscopy tomorrow.

04:12.753 --> 04:13.633
Nanxing will go with me.

04:13.633 --> 04:15.763
She's there for a color Doppler test.

04:16.193 --> 04:17.192
It's chronic.

04:17.193 --> 04:18.193
Don't worry.

04:18.713 --> 04:20.243
Okay. That makes me relieved.

04:20.243 --> 04:21.362
Nanxing is reliable.

04:21.363 --> 04:21.683
Look at you.

04:21.683 --> 04:23.152
Why Beijing on your own?

04:23.153 --> 04:24.563
You could have worked in Shanghai.

04:24.563 --> 04:25.442
Sure.

04:25.443 --> 04:26.723
How about working as a cleaner

04:27.003 --> 04:28.323
in our company?

04:29.363 --> 04:30.562
How kind of you.

04:30.563 --> 04:32.882
I'd rather not take that job.

04:32.883 --> 04:35.072
I'll be promoted next season

04:35.073 --> 04:37.122
as the associate director of the Rooms Division.

04:37.123 --> 04:39.242
Have fun at the birthday party.

04:39.243 --> 04:39.953
Lingdang.

04:39.953 --> 04:41.553
Kiss me goodbye.

04:44.193 --> 04:45.002
Bye-bye.

04:45.003 --> 04:46.122
- Bye.
- Bye.

04:46.123 --> 04:47.163
Bye.

04:56.783 --> 05:00.163
[I've bought dad a leather coat.
Buy him a new shaver or whatever instead.]

05:07.953 --> 05:08.953
Hongdou.

05:09.313 --> 05:11.482
Why didn't you reply to my message?

05:11.483 --> 05:12.832
I didn't get to!

05:12.833 --> 05:14.243
The hot and sour soup today tastes great.

05:14.243 --> 05:15.523
I get you some.

05:16.513 --> 05:17.643
What do you want from me?

05:18.073 --> 05:19.442
Just a small favor.

05:19.443 --> 05:20.313
My friend's younger sister.

05:20.313 --> 05:22.242
She's an intern at the reception.

05:22.243 --> 05:22.603
Hi.

05:22.603 --> 05:23.003
She's capable.

05:23.003 --> 05:24.433
Please guide her.

05:24.683 --> 05:26.482
Manager Xu, I'm Li Meiyu.

05:26.483 --> 05:27.122
Hi.

05:27.123 --> 05:27.393
Hello.

05:27.393 --> 05:28.473
Will you graduate this year?

05:29.603 --> 05:30.832
Are you free after work?

05:30.833 --> 05:32.192
I want to treat you to dinner.

05:32.193 --> 05:33.952
No. I need to walk my dog.

05:33.953 --> 05:35.593
You have a dog!

05:36.273 --> 05:37.883
What about tomorrow for lunch?

05:38.243 --> 05:39.723
I have a day off tomorrow, remember?

05:40.683 --> 05:41.683
Sorry.

05:42.123 --> 05:43.913
It's a very important client.

05:44.153 --> 05:44.953
I need to go.

05:44.953 --> 05:46.323
Enjoy your meal.

05:47.393 --> 05:48.242
Li Meiyu.

05:48.243 --> 05:49.392
Two tips for you.

05:49.393 --> 05:53.042
First,
do not eat spring onion or garlic at work.

05:53.043 --> 05:54.763
Second, don't drink too much water.

05:55.483 --> 05:56.483
Time to go.

06:03.363 --> 06:05.083
Hongdou!

06:07.043 --> 06:08.113
What's wrong?

06:08.563 --> 06:10.233
My back hurts.

06:12.483 --> 06:14.123
You'll take a gastroscopy tomorrow.

06:14.123 --> 06:15.243
Can you eat now?

06:15.243 --> 06:16.002
Yeah.

06:16.003 --> 06:17.363
Fasting for solids and liquids after 10.

06:17.363 --> 06:18.433
What do you want?

06:19.073 --> 06:19.923
Pizza!

06:19.923 --> 06:20.923
Sure.

06:32.043 --> 06:33.473
You've lost weight.

06:33.803 --> 06:34.922
Really?

06:34.923 --> 06:35.923
Are you on a diet?

06:36.273 --> 06:37.602
Not at all.

06:37.603 --> 06:39.323
It must be the business trip.

06:40.123 --> 06:41.833
I went away for four days last week.

06:41.833 --> 06:43.763
I visited two hotels,

06:44.833 --> 06:48.273
investigated their environments
and recreational facilities.

06:48.273 --> 06:49.952
I finished a report of 20,000 words.

06:49.953 --> 06:51.233
Can you imagine?

06:51.633 --> 06:53.152
There's more, Li Jing, our classmate,

06:53.153 --> 06:55.192
commented below my post

06:55.193 --> 06:57.843
saying I envy you! Travel at public expense!

07:05.483 --> 07:06.922
Shall we watch TV while eating?

07:06.923 --> 07:08.083
If you like.

07:11.443 --> 07:15.433
Your affluent sister
sent you a lot of cubilose!

07:16.193 --> 07:17.723
That was last year.

07:22.003 --> 07:23.433
Xu Hongdou!

07:23.683 --> 07:25.523
It expired six months ago!

07:28.153 --> 07:29.682
So is the chili sauce!

07:29.683 --> 07:32.883
I had it with noodles yesterday.

07:37.683 --> 07:41.002
Is that the nourishment from my mom?

07:41.003 --> 07:42.763
Yeah, I'd take that occasionally.

07:44.273 --> 07:44.563
What's wrong?

07:44.563 --> 07:45.752
Look at it yourself!

07:45.753 --> 07:47.883
It's gone moldy!

07:48.193 --> 07:51.633
I put that in the fridge the
last time you gave it to me.

07:51.633 --> 07:52.802
It's only been a while.

07:52.803 --> 07:55.002
The last time I visited
you was half a year ago.

07:55.003 --> 07:56.042
That long?

07:56.043 --> 07:57.312
Yeah.

07:57.313 --> 08:00.203
We're like the cowherd and the weaver fairy.

08:01.123 --> 08:02.523
Meeting twice a year

08:03.073 --> 08:04.913
even though we both live in Beijing.

08:06.603 --> 08:08.723
I'll help you clean your fridge after dinner.

08:11.123 --> 08:13.353
We work so hard to make money.

08:13.753 --> 08:14.843
But what for?

08:15.713 --> 08:16.802
For a car!

08:16.803 --> 08:18.233
You applied for the plate lottery.

08:18.603 --> 08:20.233
I'll never win it.

08:22.483 --> 08:23.712
Take it easy.

08:23.713 --> 08:24.883
Even if you bought one,

08:24.883 --> 08:26.283
there's the even-odd license plate policy.

08:26.883 --> 08:30.272
And there are rush hours
So hard to find a parking spot.

08:30.273 --> 08:34.152
I used to think well,
I can't afford a house here.

08:34.153 --> 08:35.673
I'll get a car instead.

08:36.003 --> 08:37.912
What about now?

08:37.913 --> 08:40.123
Even that is beyond me.

08:41.003 --> 08:43.433
Forget about it.

08:43.723 --> 08:45.912
Remember last spring festival?

08:45.913 --> 08:48.673
You drove a car into a
tree in your hometown.

08:49.033 --> 08:50.152
Come on.

08:50.153 --> 08:51.602
Let's move on.

08:51.603 --> 08:53.193
But that's the truth.

08:57.673 --> 08:58.882
Don't drink.

08:58.883 --> 08:59.913
It's bad for your stomach.

09:00.363 --> 09:02.003
It doesn't hurt.

09:02.723 --> 09:03.723
This one is yours.

09:04.393 --> 09:05.393
Delicious.

09:32.273 --> 09:34.363
I'm having bags under my eyes.

09:35.633 --> 09:37.322
I'm used to mine.

09:37.323 --> 09:39.272
I've got dark circles and crow's feet, too.

09:39.273 --> 09:41.163
Staying up late and there you go.

09:43.153 --> 09:45.403
Speaking of that,
I'm afraid of getting old.

09:45.673 --> 09:48.912
It's time to find a boyfriend.

09:48.913 --> 09:50.242
Go for it.

09:50.243 --> 09:51.243
You talked about

09:51.513 --> 09:52.753
your new colleague.

09:52.753 --> 09:54.242
He's your type, right?

09:54.243 --> 09:55.882
From an affluent family.

09:55.883 --> 09:56.673
And he looks cute.

09:56.673 --> 09:58.032
What's he called?

09:58.033 --> 10:00.193
Sun Zhixin.

10:01.363 --> 10:03.283
But he's six years younger than me.

10:03.553 --> 10:08.322
I'm afraid even if we date,
it won't last for long.

10:08.323 --> 10:10.122
I don't want a fruitless relationship.

10:10.123 --> 10:11.552
See that?

10:11.553 --> 10:13.152
So typical of you.

10:13.153 --> 10:14.032
Listen to yourself.

10:14.033 --> 10:16.152
Always talking.

10:16.153 --> 10:19.283
But the age gap could be a problem.

10:20.843 --> 10:21.842
What about you?

10:21.843 --> 10:23.163
Any new suitor?

10:26.083 --> 10:27.513
Yeah, a colleague.

10:27.513 --> 10:28.883
Not going to work.

10:29.203 --> 10:31.003
What's wrong?

10:31.243 --> 10:32.363
Your ex-boyfriend, Mr. Corgi.

10:32.363 --> 10:33.752
You broke up because
you live too far apart.

10:33.753 --> 10:35.912
One in Yanjiao,
and the other in East Fourth Ring.

10:35.913 --> 10:38.073
You met each other
less than once a week.

10:52.103 --> 10:55.743
[We can hardly meet.
Why don't we just break up?]

10:59.343 --> 11:01.103
[Okay.]

11:02.553 --> 11:03.883
That's to say,

11:04.603 --> 11:06.432
being too far away doesn't work.

11:06.433 --> 11:08.363
Greeting every day is annoying.

11:08.883 --> 11:09.912
He's just a colleague.

11:09.913 --> 11:11.193
I can't feel the thing.

11:13.363 --> 11:15.553
Living a hard life.

11:15.553 --> 11:17.313
I want to retire.

11:18.033 --> 11:19.272
Look at me.

11:19.273 --> 11:21.403
No house, no car, no boyfriend.

11:21.793 --> 11:23.033
I feel lost.

11:24.483 --> 11:25.753
How's that so?

11:25.753 --> 11:27.553
You have your goals.

11:27.793 --> 11:30.483
Buy a house, buy a car, get a boyfriend.

11:31.513 --> 11:32.602
Then?

11:32.603 --> 11:34.073
Then you'll be happy.

11:34.913 --> 11:36.313
For real?

11:38.633 --> 11:40.033
I hope so.

11:41.633 --> 11:42.432
Forget about it.

11:42.433 --> 11:43.643
That's too surreal.

11:44.153 --> 11:45.363
How about we

11:46.243 --> 11:48.193
take annual leaves

11:48.513 --> 11:50.883
and take a trip to Yunnan?

11:51.323 --> 11:53.003
I can't, I'm afraid.

11:53.843 --> 11:55.363
I'll soon be promoted.

11:55.673 --> 11:56.883
It must be busy.

11:58.153 --> 11:59.393
Look at you.

11:59.393 --> 12:01.032
That's annoying!

12:01.033 --> 12:02.393
You came up with the plan.

12:02.393 --> 12:03.553
You've always been busy.

12:03.553 --> 12:05.272
It's the third year you stand me up.

12:05.273 --> 12:06.323
My apology.

12:06.323 --> 12:08.673
I... I promise, next year!

12:09.553 --> 12:11.643
You've got no reputation now.

12:14.723 --> 12:17.243
How about I give you a
great birthday present?

12:17.673 --> 12:18.913
I got a pay raise!

12:22.123 --> 12:23.193
I want a handbag.

12:23.843 --> 12:24.843
You have it!

12:26.553 --> 12:27.673
I'm turning off the lamp.

12:28.553 --> 12:29.792
My back hurts.

12:29.793 --> 12:30.793
Scratch it for me.

12:30.793 --> 12:31.953
Sure.

12:42.083 --> 12:43.083
Right there.

13:14.883 --> 13:22.883
[Happiness is the meaning and the purpose of life,
the whole aim and end of human existence. Aristotle]

13:43.673 --> 13:44.673
Hongdou?

13:55.123 --> 13:57.322
What's wrong? Having a stomachache?

13:57.323 --> 14:00.203
I had some gel on my belly
when taking the Doppler test.

14:00.203 --> 14:01.602
It feels weird.

14:01.603 --> 14:02.363
Feeling itchy?

14:02.363 --> 14:03.962
Nope.

14:03.963 --> 14:05.272
Are you allergic to it?

14:05.273 --> 14:06.882
I have no idea.

14:06.883 --> 14:08.193
Feel anything?

14:12.483 --> 14:13.793
Xu Hongdou!

14:14.393 --> 14:15.643
Room No. 2.

14:17.753 --> 14:18.722
Well.

14:18.723 --> 14:19.752
Come on, I'll wait here.

14:19.753 --> 14:20.763
Come on.

14:27.433 --> 14:28.713
Is she your relative?

14:30.753 --> 14:33.283
According to the result,

14:33.723 --> 14:35.883
the size of the head of the pancreas is abnormal.

14:36.393 --> 14:38.032
What's that?

14:38.033 --> 14:40.003
The head of the pancreas, here.

14:40.483 --> 14:41.483
I suggest

14:41.723 --> 14:44.202
you register at the surgery
department and take a CT scan.

14:44.203 --> 14:46.073
I'm afraid it's acute.

14:55.883 --> 14:59.163
[CT Examination Room 2]

15:18.913 --> 15:20.392
Chen Nanxing.

15:20.393 --> 15:22.033
It's your turn.

15:34.793 --> 15:36.002
It's on your right side.

15:36.003 --> 15:37.122
Thanks.

15:37.123 --> 15:38.313
Chen Nanxing.

15:39.083 --> 15:40.002
Here are your results.

15:40.003 --> 15:41.003
Come in.

16:18.203 --> 16:19.883
Conservative treatment?

16:20.723 --> 16:22.883
Not taking surgery?

16:23.753 --> 16:25.523
Advanced pancreatic cancer.

16:25.883 --> 16:27.163
It has spread.

16:29.003 --> 16:30.632
She can only take conservative treatment.

16:30.633 --> 16:32.363
To ease her pain.

16:32.753 --> 16:34.553
But she's so young.

16:34.553 --> 16:36.122
How could that be?

16:36.123 --> 16:37.633
She's the only child of her family.

16:37.633 --> 16:39.913
I can't believe it.

16:41.083 --> 16:43.913
Thankfully,
your examination results are okay.

16:43.913 --> 16:46.552
I didn't hear you
clearly on the phone.

16:46.553 --> 16:46.913
I thought it was you.

16:46.913 --> 16:48.323
My heart stopped when I heard...

16:48.323 --> 16:49.362
Mom.

16:49.363 --> 16:50.523
Well.

16:51.363 --> 16:52.482
I'm having dinner now.

16:52.483 --> 16:53.603
Dishes get cold.

16:54.363 --> 16:55.763
Carry on.

16:56.433 --> 16:57.793
That's it. Bye-bye.

17:59.883 --> 18:03.163
[We sincerely apologize for the inconvenience.
Xu Hongdou, Waldorf Hotel.]

18:06.913 --> 18:07.433
It hurts.

18:07.433 --> 18:08.882
Kangkang.

18:08.883 --> 18:10.673
Does your mom know you're here?

18:11.523 --> 18:12.843
She's having dinner.

18:12.843 --> 18:14.712
She asks me to stay here with Nanxing.

18:14.713 --> 18:15.603
Good.

18:15.603 --> 18:17.513
Taking care of her.

18:19.843 --> 18:21.513
Got a message from work.

18:22.713 --> 18:24.273
That hurts.

18:24.673 --> 18:25.393
I knew it.

18:25.393 --> 18:27.843
You have to work
until you're dead.

18:29.123 --> 18:29.843
Come on.

18:29.843 --> 18:31.672
Take care of yourself, alright?

18:31.673 --> 18:34.323
The misery never ends. Why not quit it?

18:34.843 --> 18:36.753
Don't say that right here.

18:37.843 --> 18:39.753
You know what I mean.

18:40.083 --> 18:40.843
I'll quit.

18:40.843 --> 18:41.713
My hands hurt.

18:41.713 --> 18:43.273
You hit me so hard. Let's try another one.

18:43.713 --> 18:45.992
How about... rock,
scissors, paper?

18:45.993 --> 18:46.993
Sure!

18:47.323 --> 18:49.362
Rock, scissors, paper.

18:49.363 --> 18:51.602
Rock, scissors, paper.

18:51.603 --> 18:52.953
Rock.

18:53.953 --> 18:55.323
Rock.

18:56.913 --> 18:58.232
Rock.

18:58.233 --> 18:59.432
Mom!

18:59.433 --> 19:01.083
Are you okay, mom?

19:01.563 --> 19:02.083
Kangkang, look away!

19:02.083 --> 19:03.163
Doctor!

19:03.433 --> 19:04.672
Nurse!

19:04.673 --> 19:05.283
Doctor!

19:05.283 --> 19:06.473
There, there. I'm with you.

19:23.563 --> 19:24.563
Hongdou.

19:24.913 --> 19:25.603
Mom!

19:25.603 --> 19:26.842
I want some oden.

19:26.843 --> 19:27.883
Mom!

19:29.323 --> 19:30.403
Mom...

19:32.233 --> 19:33.392
A few more eggs.

19:33.393 --> 19:33.843
Sure.

19:33.843 --> 19:34.362
Eggs.

19:34.363 --> 19:35.363
There.

19:36.713 --> 19:37.953
I want that one.

19:40.633 --> 19:42.433
Soup. More soup, please.

19:44.603 --> 19:46.673
It reminds me of our days in college.

19:47.913 --> 19:50.193
I'd always get hungry
when the lights were out.

19:50.953 --> 19:53.403
And I'd ask you to buy
spicy hot pot for me.

19:55.123 --> 19:57.953
Yeah,
the restaurant went bankrupt in the end.

19:59.153 --> 20:00.673
No, they didn't!

20:01.123 --> 20:04.042
They made enough money and
bought a house in their hometown.

20:04.043 --> 20:05.363
Their kids were in middle school.

20:05.363 --> 20:06.883
They went back to take care of the kid.

20:07.123 --> 20:08.282
Really?

20:08.283 --> 20:08.673
Of course!

20:08.673 --> 20:10.403
They told me!

20:10.843 --> 20:12.713
So good at small talk.

20:14.673 --> 20:16.673
You're way too busy.

20:18.473 --> 20:21.753
Right now,
you should live a happy life!

20:22.283 --> 20:24.082
Eat well, drink well.

20:24.083 --> 20:25.283
Talk to others.

20:25.283 --> 20:26.153
Exchange thoughts.

20:26.153 --> 20:27.842
Make friends.

20:27.843 --> 20:30.913
The money we make. What's that for?

20:34.123 --> 20:35.913
A better life.

20:39.603 --> 20:41.643
I used to tell myself

20:41.913 --> 20:45.403
to get a boyfriend soon,
get married and have a baby.

20:48.043 --> 20:51.363
I'm afraid I'd be
lonely when I'm old.

20:51.633 --> 20:53.273
Now I see.

20:53.563 --> 20:54.912
That was nothing.

20:54.913 --> 20:56.993
I never knew what I really want.

20:57.913 --> 20:59.513
You want happiness.

21:01.523 --> 21:02.882
For me right now?

21:02.883 --> 21:04.803
Health is happiness.

21:12.043 --> 21:13.643
Do you remember our classmate,

21:14.393 --> 21:15.233
Li Ruiyuan?

21:15.233 --> 21:16.632
She has two babies already.

21:16.633 --> 21:17.803
For real?

21:17.803 --> 21:19.513
Two babies already?

21:19.953 --> 21:21.432
I have no idea!

21:21.433 --> 21:22.522
Look at me.

21:22.523 --> 21:23.843
I don't have any.

21:24.763 --> 21:26.673
Yeah, you're still single.

21:28.763 --> 21:32.753
Why are you so mean?

21:39.913 --> 21:41.123
Take turnip.

22:25.763 --> 22:27.673
Turnip tastes good!

22:46.153 --> 22:47.323
It's okay.

23:07.883 --> 23:10.163
[Symposium on Asian Biotechnology and Medicine]

23:17.473 --> 23:20.472
1603 is not ready. What do you mean?

23:20.473 --> 23:21.603
A smell of hot pot?

23:23.153 --> 23:24.602
Try air freshener spray.

23:24.603 --> 23:26.673
Executive Suites are overbooked today.

23:26.913 --> 23:27.913
Okay.

23:28.323 --> 23:29.603
Thanks, Hongdou.

23:33.673 --> 23:34.882
Excuse me.

23:34.883 --> 23:35.762
Excuse me.

23:35.763 --> 23:36.912
What's up?

23:36.913 --> 23:38.163
That's loud!

23:41.323 --> 23:42.563
Manager Xu!

23:47.953 --> 23:48.233
Over here.

23:48.233 --> 23:48.633
Sorry.

23:48.633 --> 23:49.713
It doesn't match.

23:54.823 --> 23:56.663
[Nanxing's mom]

23:57.233 --> 23:58.403
Hold on a second.

24:03.123 --> 24:04.513
Hello?

24:11.953 --> 24:13.323
I'm on my way.

24:27.323 --> 24:28.603
Ask for leave for me.

24:29.123 --> 24:30.403
Manager Xu?

27:05.603 --> 27:06.883
You have problems with your stomach.

27:06.883 --> 27:08.393
You should eat slowly.

27:08.393 --> 27:10.632
I know you're busy. Still, eat well.

27:10.633 --> 27:12.803
You need balanced nutrition.

28:05.153 --> 28:06.273
Sir.

28:06.523 --> 28:07.993
You lost a gear.

28:08.233 --> 28:10.233
It's grinding.

28:14.123 --> 28:16.283
It's been working for too long. Worn out now.

28:16.283 --> 28:17.473
The clock would be inaccurate with it.

28:17.473 --> 28:18.993
I'm swapping it with a new one.

28:51.603 --> 28:53.953
You may leave
after taking the IV.

28:56.393 --> 28:58.993
Doctor, am I dying?

29:00.433 --> 29:01.673
I've given you an examination.

29:01.673 --> 29:02.912
You're fine.

29:02.913 --> 29:03.633
You fainted.

29:03.633 --> 29:04.882
It's not as concerning as it looks.

29:04.883 --> 29:07.392
You had temporary ischemia and hypoxia

29:07.393 --> 29:09.632
due to excessive pressure or panic.

29:09.633 --> 29:11.522
Just relax.

29:11.523 --> 29:13.473
Try not to be anxious.

29:13.913 --> 29:15.282
I thought I was sick.

29:15.283 --> 29:17.122
You suffer from
anemia and malnutrition.

29:17.123 --> 29:18.152
You need iron supplementation.

29:18.153 --> 29:19.192
Be sure to eat on time.

29:19.193 --> 29:20.122
Have more eggs and meat.

29:20.123 --> 29:21.753
Don't skip meals just for losing weight.

29:22.123 --> 29:23.233
Thank you.

29:23.233 --> 29:23.673
No problem.

29:23.673 --> 29:24.802
You're free to go
after taking the IV.

29:24.803 --> 29:25.843
Okay.

29:35.123 --> 29:36.472
Manager Xu.

29:36.473 --> 29:38.192
I've paid the bills.

29:38.193 --> 29:39.762
I'll lay the test report here.

29:39.763 --> 29:40.763
Okay.

29:41.153 --> 29:42.282
Thank you.

29:42.283 --> 29:43.522
Well.

29:43.523 --> 29:45.713
I have an emergency.

29:47.153 --> 29:49.523
It's my boyfriend's birthday.

29:49.523 --> 29:51.883
He takes a flight here from Guangzhou.

29:52.713 --> 29:54.912
Go for him. I'm fine.

29:54.913 --> 29:55.913
I...

29:56.123 --> 29:58.603
I should wait till the IV is over.

29:58.603 --> 29:59.603
I'm feeling alright.

29:59.603 --> 30:00.672
Just go.

30:00.673 --> 30:02.233
He must be waiting.

30:04.123 --> 30:04.882
Okay.

30:04.883 --> 30:06.472
I'm leaving.

30:06.473 --> 30:07.193
Manager Xu.

30:07.193 --> 30:09.843
Call me immediately
if you need anything.

30:10.123 --> 30:10.882
See you tomorrow.

30:10.883 --> 30:11.883
See you tomorrow.

30:45.953 --> 30:47.193
Hongdou.

30:48.953 --> 30:50.433
I don't know how to put this

30:51.603 --> 30:54.323
in front of you.

30:55.953 --> 30:57.753
I guess I have to talk to you

30:59.043 --> 31:02.193
over voice messages.

31:04.123 --> 31:07.643
Maybe you don't get the chance to reply.

31:08.233 --> 31:12.323
Maybe this is my last word.

31:15.633 --> 31:17.803
When I'm gone,

31:18.883 --> 31:21.843
my parents would suffer the most.

31:23.913 --> 31:25.673
Please give them a call

31:26.763 --> 31:29.043
during festivals.

31:29.523 --> 31:31.043
Talk to them for me.

31:32.603 --> 31:34.043
A call is enough.

31:34.603 --> 31:36.323
No need for anything else.

31:40.913 --> 31:43.163
I know about them.

31:44.153 --> 31:48.163
They never ask others for a favor.

31:49.883 --> 31:54.713
I'm sure they'd be
glad to hear from you.

32:09.433 --> 32:11.043
When I'm gone,

32:13.283 --> 32:14.803
don't be sad for too long.

32:17.523 --> 32:19.403
Cry it out.

32:19.633 --> 32:21.042
Let it out.

32:21.043 --> 32:22.233
That's enough.

32:22.913 --> 32:25.233
You know about me.

32:25.563 --> 32:27.562
I didn't do evil things.

32:27.563 --> 32:28.563
Right?

32:29.363 --> 32:31.323
I'll go to a great place after death.

32:32.043 --> 32:33.043
Don't worry.

32:35.043 --> 32:36.603
Besides,

32:36.913 --> 32:39.363
I won't be painful by that time.

32:39.803 --> 32:41.563
I'm freed.

32:42.603 --> 32:44.753
You should be happy for me.

32:45.523 --> 32:46.523
Don't you think?

32:49.633 --> 32:51.753
I regret

32:53.233 --> 32:56.403
not confessing to Sun Zhixin.

32:58.673 --> 33:00.323
The earlier I make my move,

33:01.803 --> 33:06.233
the sooner the romance arrives.

33:07.673 --> 33:08.673
Right?

33:11.953 --> 33:13.123
Right now,

33:16.523 --> 33:18.083
much as I want,

33:19.233 --> 33:21.603
I can't witness the world away from here.

33:23.363 --> 33:25.953
But you can witness it for me.

33:29.473 --> 33:31.043
I want to eat,

33:31.283 --> 33:32.883
to drink,

33:33.283 --> 33:34.913
to play.

33:35.883 --> 33:37.713
The things I wanted to try,

33:39.043 --> 33:40.473
I left them to you.

33:40.473 --> 33:42.603
To eat, to drink, to play.

33:45.123 --> 33:46.803
But there's one thing.

33:47.363 --> 33:52.273
Be sure to check the
expiration date before you eat.

33:52.523 --> 33:55.233
You'd always leave
them in the fridge

33:55.233 --> 33:56.913
and forget about them.

33:58.713 --> 34:00.043
What's more,

34:01.193 --> 34:04.003
be sure to eat well,

34:04.913 --> 34:06.882
sleep well.

34:06.883 --> 34:08.673
Live a good life.

34:11.473 --> 34:13.273
Must be happy.

34:17.113 --> 34:18.833
Must go out

34:20.363 --> 34:22.673
and open your mind to others.

34:24.033 --> 34:25.793
Make some friends.

34:27.883 --> 34:29.083
All in all,

34:30.203 --> 34:32.123
there has to be someone

34:32.953 --> 34:35.193
to take up my place.

34:35.553 --> 34:36.643
Right?

34:38.553 --> 34:40.282
When seeing someone you like,

34:40.283 --> 34:42.563
take the initiative. Go after him.

34:44.073 --> 34:45.993
I know you are good-looking.

34:45.993 --> 34:48.673
But you can't just sit there and wait.

34:49.553 --> 34:51.003
Have a relationship.

34:51.283 --> 34:53.163
Seize the day.

34:54.723 --> 34:57.112
That's my assignment for you.

34:57.113 --> 34:58.443
Do you hear me?

35:01.593 --> 35:03.793
When I'm gone,

35:04.323 --> 35:05.473
be sure to be happy for me.

35:05.473 --> 35:07.193
Live a good life for me.

35:09.113 --> 35:10.793
Stop wasting your time.

35:11.473 --> 35:12.753
Take care.

35:13.473 --> 35:16.163
Live your life the way you want.

35:18.643 --> 35:20.603
I will bless you for sure.

35:21.433 --> 35:22.963
But on one condition.

35:23.913 --> 35:25.923
Be sure to burn paper money for me.

35:27.993 --> 35:29.393
The more the better.

35:32.843 --> 35:33.963
I'm tired.

35:35.363 --> 35:36.363
So much for now.

35:38.203 --> 35:40.003
That's a separate line for my last word.

35:41.723 --> 35:43.353
I'll make amendments

35:43.643 --> 35:44.873
when I think of something new.

35:52.643 --> 35:53.873
By the way,

35:55.913 --> 35:58.443
thankfully, I didn't confess to Sun Zhixin.

36:00.803 --> 36:02.873
Or I'd be a drag.

36:05.283 --> 36:06.713
Alright. That's all.

36:07.683 --> 36:09.123
Enough talking.

36:10.843 --> 36:12.123
I'm out.

36:13.433 --> 36:14.523
I'm feeling

36:16.163 --> 36:18.273
great today.

36:19.513 --> 36:21.243
I could live for another 500 years.

36:21.243 --> 36:22.443
Can you believe that?

36:26.553 --> 36:28.123
Will you drop by after work today?

36:29.683 --> 36:32.163
I want some lazy dragon rolls.

36:33.763 --> 36:35.713
Buy me some, please.

37:49.913 --> 37:55.383
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

37:57.353 --> 38:02.303
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

38:04.763 --> 38:10.813
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

38:11.133 --> 38:16.513
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

38:19.473 --> 38:24.863
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

38:26.843 --> 38:31.703
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

38:34.273 --> 38:40.473
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

38:40.803 --> 38:46.993
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

38:49.083 --> 38:55.522
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

38:55.523 --> 39:02.273
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

39:03.653 --> 39:05.702
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

39:05.703 --> 39:10.093
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

39:10.333 --> 39:17.442
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

39:17.443 --> 39:24.403
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

39:29.623 --> 39:32.183
[Letter of Resignation]

39:40.593 --> 39:41.762
Yeah, mom.

39:41.763 --> 39:43.722
I got three months of paid leave.

39:43.723 --> 39:45.483
I haven't taken any vacation for years.

39:46.553 --> 39:47.682
I won't go home now.

39:47.683 --> 39:50.512
I want to spend a few months in Yunnan.

39:50.513 --> 39:51.833
Take a break.

39:56.723 --> 39:58.043
I want to travel.

